The palm anchors, decoding, weighted suppression, crop geometry and tracking
ROI formulas follow the MediaPipe graph/calculator contracts. Neural model
assets are downloaded separately and are not embedded in this source tree.

Sources:
https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe/tree/master/mediapipe/modules/palm_detection
https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe/tree/master/mediapipe/modules/hand_landmark
https://ai.google.dev/edge/mediapipe/solutions/vision/hand_landmarker
https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/hand_landmarker/hand_landmarker/float16/1/hand_landmarker.task

The exported world landmarks are model-relative predictions in meters. They
are not a substitute for calibrated stereo or a camera-to-world transform.
